---
---
<section class="sec sec-alt" id="usecases">
  <div class="glow-orb glow-orb-purple"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="sec-hdr">
      <span class="sec-eyebrow" style="color: #a78bfa">Who it's for</span>
      <h2>Built for teams that ship fast</h2>
      <p>From day-one startups to regulated enterprises — feature flags adapt to how you work.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="uc-grid">
      <div class="uc glass-card">
        <div class="uc-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2 3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Startups</h3>
        <span class="uc-tag">Ship fearlessly on day one</span>
        <p>Roll out features to beta users, target by plan tier, instant kill switches for rollback. Zero infrastructure cost — Firebase free tier handles it all.</p>
        <div class="uc-example">
          <code>getFlag("feature.onboarding_v2")</code>
          <span>→ 50% rollout to new signups</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="uc glass-card">
        <div class="uc-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Growing Teams</h3>
        <span class="uc-tag">Collaborate without stepping on toes</span>
        <p>RBAC ensures devs can't touch production API keys. Full audit log shows who changed what, when. Slack webhooks keep everyone informed in real-time.</p>
        <div class="uc-example">
          <code>Role: editor → can't revoke keys</code>
          <span>→ separation of concerns built-in</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="uc glass-card">
        <div class="uc-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Regulated Industries</h3>
        <span class="uc-tag">Compliance without the price tag</span>
        <p>GDPR data deletion tools, immutable audit trails, environment separation, consent-aware mode. Self-hosted means your data never leaves your infrastructure.</p>
        <div class="uc-example">
          <code>consentAware: true</code>
          <span>→ no personalization without consent</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  .uc-grid { display: grid; gap: 18px; grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  @media(min-width:768px) { .uc-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }

  .uc { padding: 30px; border-radius: 20px; transition: transform .4s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1), border-color .3s, box-shadow .4s; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .uc:hover { transform: translateY(-6px); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.14); box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.5), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.08); }

  .uc-icon { width: 40px; height: 40px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.04); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.7); }

  .uc h3 { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.02em; margin-bottom: 5px; }
  .uc-tag { display: block; font-size: 13px; color: #a78bfa; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .uc p { font-size: 13.5px; color: #9ca3af; line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 16px; flex: 1; }

  .uc-example { padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05); }
  .uc-example code { display: block; font-family: "SF Mono","Fira Code",monospace; font-size: 11px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.6); margin-bottom: 3px; }
  .uc-example span { font-size: 11px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.3); }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .uc { padding: 22px; }
    .uc h3 { font-size: 16px; }
    .uc-tag { font-size: 12px; }
    .uc p { font-size: 13px; }
  }
</style>
